  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 916ca174c9f91bc47ab29cda8fbdcf0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memory_clock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MemoryData
  openingLine: This reminds me of...
  lines:
  - Dad wound this clock every Sunday morning, before he even had his coffee.
  - He said if anyone forgot, even once, the whole house would fall behind. He was
    so ridiculous sometimes.
  - "On school nights I\u2019d lie awake listening to it tick, counting until I heard
    his keys in the door."
  - Sometimes I lost count and fell asleep before he got home.
  - But every morning, the clock was still going. He never forgot.
  - It stopped a while ago... and I never really learned how to wind it.
